<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RUGBY UNION-ARGENTINA'S GRAU JOINS TRANSVAAL.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-ARGENTINA'S GRAU JOINS TRANSVAAL.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina test prop Roberto Grau signed a one-year contract with South African provincial side Transvaal on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Grau, 27, joined the Golden Lions from Cuyo and will make his competitive debut in the Super 12 series which begins in March.</p>
<p>Capped 14 times, he played in both Argentina's test defeats against South Africa at the end of last year.</p>
</text>
